	<string name="hwp.luck.stat.tip">Rarer loot comes up more often: chests, strongboxes, abyss cracks, keys and fish. A chest never drops more often, only better, except its dyes, which Luck finds more of.\n\nYour Luck %luck%: rarer outcomes x%factor%. A chest or strongbox rolls at the Luck of whoever opens it, and the whole party gets what it rolled; an abyss crack, which nobody opens, at the party's average (x%party%).\n\nThe party's average also reaches each new floor: a chance of an extra secret room and of the imp, more and better food, potions, chests and other floor rewards, rarer blueprints, more fishing holes, more and higher keys and more ace chests. At the roulette table it raises your winnings by the same percent.

Luck never changes the chance of a skill, item or trinket effect.</string>
	<string name="stat.custom.hwpluck">Luck</string>
	<string name="hwp.hoh1.missing">Heroes of Hammerwatch 1 content is not installed, so these use stand-ins: %list%. Everything else works. To add it, own HoH1 and install HammerwatchPlus with run.cmd from its project page (hwp hoh1 lists them).</string>
	<string name="hwp.hoh1.none">No enabled HammerwatchPlus mod uses Heroes of Hammerwatch 1 content.</string>
	<string name="hwp.hoh1.present">Heroes of Hammerwatch 1 content installed</string>
	<string name="hwp.packages.mismatch">HammerwatchPlus packages from different updates are enabled together (%list% differ from the rest), so some mods may misbehave. Update them all in the Steam Workshop, or enable only HammerwatchPlus-All.</string>
